  "notes": [
    {
      "label": "1.",
      "text": "When function code 167 is utilized as a shaping algorithm for analog in/ channel (function code 222), its tunable specifications are not adaptable.",
      "manual_page": 621,
      "context": "general"
    },
    {
      "label": "2.",
      "text": "When function code 167 is used as a shaping algorithm, it can not at the same time also be used as a logic function because the block output will not respond to the specification S1 input.",
      "manual_page": 621,
      "context": "general"
    },
    {
      "label": "3.",
      "text": "Multiple instances and combinations of function code 177 and 222 function blocks may utilize the same function code 167 function block as a shaping algorithm. The function code 167 shaping algorithm function block is not required to be in the same segment as the function code 177 or function code 222 blocks.",
      "manual_page": 621,
      "context": "general"
    },
    {
      "label": "1.",
      "text": "Maximum values are: 9,998 for the BRC-100, IMMFP11/12 31,998 for the HAC",
      "manual_page": 622,
      "context": "specifications"
    }
